{"hits": {"hits": [{"metadata": {"authors": [{"full_name": "Smirnov, Vladimir A."}], "publication_info": [{"journal_volume": "134", "page_end": "137", "year": 1990, "journal_record": {"$ref": "https://inspirehep.net/api/journals/1214791"}, "page_start": "109", "journal_title": "Commun.Math.Phys."}], "texkeys": ["Smirnov:1990rz"], "abstracts": [{"value": "Asymptotic expansions of renormalized Feynman amplitudes in limits of large momenta and/or masses are proved. The corresponding asymptotic operator expansions for theS-matrix, composite operators and their time-ordered products are presented. Coefficient functions of these expansions are homogeneous within a regularization of dimensional or analytic type. Furthermore, they are explicitly expressed in terms of renormalized Feynman amplitudes (at the diagrammatic level) and certain Green functions (at the operator level)."}], "control_number": 307563, "dois": [{"value": "10.1007/BF02102092"}], "titles": [{"title": "Asymptotic expansions in limits of large momenta and masses"}], "author_count": 1, "document_type": ["article"]}, "id": "307563", "created": "1992-04-05T00:00:00+00:00", "updated": "2023-03-10T09:21:29.776954+00:00", "links": {"bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/307563?format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/307563?format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/307563?format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/307563?format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/307563?format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/307563?format=cv", "citations": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=refersto%3Arecid%3A307563"}}], "total": 1}, "links": {"self": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?sort=mostcited&q=j%20Commun.Math.Phys.%2C134%2C109&size=3&page=1&fields=control_number,titles.title,authors.full_name,author_count,publication_info,arxiv_eprints.value,dois.value,texkeys,abstracts